      "role": "user",
      "content": "but i literally feel it happening like a migraine... my head is pounding in that same spot it always does. i have some triptans left over from my last prescription, can i just take a couple of those and sleep it off? maybe it's just a bad one and once the meds kick in the weakness will go away?",
